msgid "Express checkout buttons stay active while this required field is shown, a customer can reach payment before filling it in. Depending on the gateway, the order is either stopped with an error or placed without this field. This is because Express Checkout > Ignore Required Custom Fields is turned on."
msgstr "Gumbi za hitri zaključek nakupa ostanejo aktivni, medtem ko je prikazano to obvezno polje, zato lahko stranka pride do plačila, preden ga izpolni. Odvisno od plačilnega prehoda je naročilo bodisi ustavljeno z napako bodisi oddano brez tega polja. To je zato, ker je vklopljena možnost Express Checkout > Ignore Required Custom Fields."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/slots/CustomFieldEditor.tsx:225
msgid "Express checkout buttons are hidden while this required field is shown, so it cannot be skipped. This is because Express Checkout > Ignore Required Custom Fields is turned off."
msgstr "Gumbi za hitri zaključek nakupa so skriti, medtem ko je prikazano to obvezno polje, zato ga ni mogoče preskočiti. To je zato, ker je možnost Express Checkout > Ignore Required Custom Fields izklopljena."

